<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="HAG" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">HAGGAI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Haggai</para>
  <para style="toc2">HAGGAI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hag</para>
  <para style="mt1">HAGGAI</para>
  <para style="mt2">Haggai</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">Haggai ccauh tuh BC 520 lyaze profeh Haggai kya Bawipaw nynh a hopaw bya dynpaw hae kha ccakhungpaw nynh thua. Judah hae tuh seetangnaw kyate ki hae zah Jerusalem kya kum beihtaraw a um vae hae, thuasalama Beikinn tuh rohbabu lan a um ung. Haggai nynh Beikinn raethui lan tuhou hae zah Pachia nynh malang ccyh kya hythuanaw te daenaw ae pya cih oh, a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Beikinn sakthui lan kawpyanaw 1.1-15</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngaengannaw te ngaehoinaw bya 2.1-23</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beikinn Sak lan Kawpyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siapharan Darias nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum ningnaw, sawpaw sah taruhnaw, nin kheit nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh profeh Haggai kyate Judah ram uktu bawi, Shealtiel ccapaw Zerubbabel kalan te Jehozadak ccapaw Joshua, ranpibawi lupi kalan yn thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:24-5:2">Ezr 4.24—5.2</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 6:14">6.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: E ccungccaw hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn saknaw ccyh zaw loh khyh, a ci hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh profeh Haggai kalan yn thua zah a hopaw tuh: <verse number="4" style="v" />E inn tuh rohbabu lan a um lyaze, naemaw tuh nae inn ahoyhoypaw kya um ccyh athua zawtou? <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Nae hiinzia hynh tuaku tua oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Nanning nynh ccacii patae na tu oh zah, looh beihtaraw kyalya kha na rue oh; na ae oh zemah phe byn lan na ae khyh oh; na nia oh zemah phe byn lan na neih khyh oh, boeining na lawku oh zemah, lu kheit sanmah a khualung khyh; nae ryalaw mee na mue oh zemah a uapaw zaw lungkhu lang sang khylan na mue oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nae hiinzia kha tuaku tua oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Mua lang kaete thing kha lah oh lah, inn kha sak oh, tuhteze nynh tuh-e inn lungkhu khe ka lungrythua cih zah sawtuanaw ka ccou cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="9" style="v" />Nanning nynh patae kha na ccung oh zemah na mue oh paw tuh beihtaraw; tuh-e tuh innvaw he na thuakhae oh te, ccaring ka mung. Pawccemou? cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. Nanning balyn nynh naemaw inn raveih lang na ccue lya oh khe, ka inn tuh rohbabu lan a um keiccu nynh thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze luki lang e vaawlui nynh dangtui ccawsah khyh zah, laephi nynh ccathae pousah khyh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ram te mua hae kya thuasah, ccathae, misutui thawpaw, chitui kya thuasah, laephi kyate apoupaw miakaw kya thuasah, ccungccaw hae te sarangpaw hae kya thuasah, mih ryalawnaw balyn kya thuasah khuaakannaw kha ka konua vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tetuh Shealtiel ccapaw Zerubbabel, Jehozadak ccapaw Joshua, ranpibawi lupi te a laehypaw ccungccaw balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia bya kha thuasah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia nynh a sawpaw profeh Haggai bya kha thuasah ngae hae zah, ccungccaw hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> raw kha a ri hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> zeccuetu Haggai nynh ccungccaw hae kyakhe, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae kya ka um,” a cipaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha a hopya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah ram uktu bawi, Shealtiel ccapaw Zerubbabel, te Jehozadak ccapaw Joshua, ranpibawi lupi, te a laehypaw ccungccaw hae balyn kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh mih lung a thosah hae; minmin nynh oun cceih hae zah mih Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kyakhe, <verse number="15" style="v" />sawpaw sah taruhnaw, nin kuin lae pali nin khe rya a law hae.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Malang Ccyh kya Beikinn Phu-enaw</para>
  <para style="p">Darias nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum ningnaw, <verse number="1" style="v" />sawpaw sah sarinaw, nin kuin lae kheit nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh profeh Haggai kalan yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah ram uktu bawi, Shealtiel ccapaw Zerubbabel, te Jehozadak ccapaw Joshua, ranpibawi lupi, te a laehypaw ccungccaw hae balyn kha hynhte hopah hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />E inn langmawlya a phu-enaw kha a muih boi paw nanning laku kya hummou a um ung? Atu hynh pawtemou na muih oh? Nae muihnaw kya accakaepaw hawte thua khyh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:12">Ezr 3.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuhzemah, pou Zerubbabel, na rawthung sah, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. Pou Jehozadak ccapaw Joshua, ranpibawi lupi, na rawthung sah; ram kya-e ccungccaw hae balyn, nae rawthung sah, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci; ryalawtua oh, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci, <verse number="5" style="v" />Izip ram kyate na pou lya oh ze, bya kae kinpyaku oh thyhte, nae kya ka um, a ci. Ka muisaw tuh nae laku kya a um; rih nan oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:45-46">Exo 29.45-46</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawccecize vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: sosoh aro te, vaawlui, laephi, rili te laerou kha vaekheit bua ka hy ung cih;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:26">Heb 12.26</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />minphuin hae balyn kha ka thyngsakuh cih hae, tuhteze nynh minphuin hae balyn kya-e sisua tuh yn thua cih zah, e inn hynh phu-enaw te phe ka biasah cih. <verse number="8" style="v" />Sui te ngun tuh ka kya-e nynh thua cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="9" style="v" />E inn nyalang e a phu-enaw tuh langmawlya e a phu-enaw laeze alehua cih, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci; e hmin kyahin hoirumnaw ka nung cih, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Penaw te Byakinpyakunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Darias nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum ningnaw, sawpaw sah takuanaw, nin kuin lae pali nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh profeh Haggai kalan yn thua zah: <verse number="11" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Ranpibawi hae kha byapaenaw kong khiatua hae: <verse number="12" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh athyaapaw saw kha a boeining te lungde zah, tuh-e tuhte sanlou, saw avoipaw, misutui, chitui, looh hankhakheit kha a ty lanze, tuh-e tuh athyaapaw lang a tang cih tou? cite khia hae zah, ranpibawi hae nynh, “Thyaa lan khyh,” a ci hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh Haggai nynh, “Michi rhua a ty keiccuze athyaa leipaw lukhakheit nynh hynh-e hae ccangkhakheit kha a ty lanze, tuh-e tuh athupaw lang a tang cih tou?” cite khia hae zah, ranpibawi hae nynh, “Athupaw lang a tang cih,” a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:11-22">Nam 19.11-22</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Te Haggai nynh, e ccungccaw hae te ka malang um hae paw hynh-e minphuin hae tuh tuhawte nynh athua hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci; mih kuih te rya a law hae paw miakaw tuh tuhawte nynh athua; minmin nynh silawhang vawlan a pya hae paw tuh thyaa khyh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama atunin te malang ccyh kya yn thua lanpaw kha tuatua oh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn kya lung ccangkheit vawlan lung ccangkheit khangthy athua maw kya pawtemah na um oh? <verse number="16" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh looh apumkuhpaw phu kuin kalan he a ccia ze, phu haw kyalya a um; lukhakheit nynh misutui ang sung pangaw kha law lan cite misu mianaw akhu kalan he a ccia ze, ang kuin kyalya a um cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Naemaw te nae ryalaw athae-apaw balyn kha aku chinaw, aku rounaw te hya khate de kae tah oh; tuhzemah ka kalan nae kithui khyh oh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="18" style="v" />Sawpaw sah takuanaw, nin kuin lae pali nin, atunin te malang tuh hoyte tua ccavae oh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn aleihpaw na bing nin oh kyate hoyte tua ccavae oh: <verse number="19" style="v" />Byng kya ccacii ccangkheit san a um tou? Misu ku, thaeku ku, ccalee ku te oliv ku hae tuh athae thae loh khyh hae tou? Atunin te vae tuh hythua kae pya vae cih oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Zerubbabel kha Byakinpyakunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuh-e sawpaw nin kuin lae pali nin khe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Haggai kalan vae ningnaw yn thua: <verse number="21" style="v" />Judah ram uktu bawi Zerubbabel kyakhe, vaaw te lae kha ka hy vae cih, <verse number="22" style="v" />peenaw hae kya-e bawitungkhung hae kha ka dawleih vae cih; minphuin hae kya-e peenaw thawzung kha ka roh vae cih, te marangle hae te a ccikuhtu hae kha ka dawleih vae cih hae; marang hae te a ccikuhtu hae lu kheit cci tuh mih ban hae thaloi khate a chih cih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh, pou ka ryalahtu Zerubbabel, Shealtiel ccapaw, tuin nin khe nang kha kae lah cih zah minkhianawpaw kuihpu lang kae rae cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci; nang kha phe kae po vae, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
</usx>